WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.980
White Cats will taste defeat!
Touwa guys will not be beat!

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.480
White Cats will taste defeat!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:10.740
Faster! You won't beat the White Cats
at the sports festival next week like that!

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.860
-Show me what you're made of!
-Yeah!

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:17.340
Hey, Persia.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:20.120
We've been dating for a while, right?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.750
Yeah. What are you--?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.770
I'm starting to want it.

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:28.750
I hunger for it.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.880
You want it? What do you mean?
Are you hungry for power?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.610
Don't play dumb.

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.530
I shouldn't have to tell you.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.490
Make one for me.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.770
M--make...?

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:46.270
We can't! We're still students!
It's unheard of! Stay away, you animal!

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:49.650
What are you talking about?
I'm talking about a handmade bento!

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.530
Bento?

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:56.160
I said it! How embarrassing.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:00.800
-That wouldn't really be a big deal.
-Are you sure?

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.580
I have a responsibility
to answer to my people.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:10.340
You're not obligated or anything.
And what did you think I meant by "make"?

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.650
Shut up! One more word
and I'll rip your jaw bone out!

00:01:14.650 --> 00:01:15.970
What!

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:51.780
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:52.160 --> 00:02:00.630
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:06.630
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:11.970
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:02:12.220 --> 00:02:17.140
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:20.900
So that I can protect you

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:26.400
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:31.950
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:37.000
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:43.960
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.450
Romio and the Sports Festival

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.190
It's finally come true.
Romio and the Sports Festival

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:55.820
Inuzuka, say "Ah"!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:59.490
My dream of having my girlfriend feed me
her hand cooked food!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.370
Good grief.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.370
If I don't hurry, class is going to start.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.180
I should've thought this through
before committing.

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:12.430
Who knew it'd be this hard.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:13.970
Just a moment, Persia.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:16.100
What is it, Miss Kitchen Maid?

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:19.020
I'm hearing sounds that don't sound like cooking.

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:20.480
Really?

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.760
The cookies are done!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.730
Looks like they've been burnt to a crisp.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:30.830
I'm sorry. You even let me use the dorm kitchen.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:35.160
It's fine. But haven't you been cooking since last night?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.580
Why don't you rest a little?

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.000
I can't, school is about to start--

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.000
Oh, no, Persia! The oil overheated and caught fire!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.800
Water! Wait, water is bad for oil fires, right?

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:47.510
The microwave is sparking!

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:50.040
I left a spoon in there!

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.790
Persia's cooking.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:59.550
I no longer have the luxury of choice.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.290
Stable

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.730
Well...

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.780
I made one for you.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:10.200
It looks so good! I'm impressed!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.310
It's amazing you made this!

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.190
It's not...

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.920
Persia?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:25.700
Anyway, I'll feed you, so open your mouth.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.600
-Are you crazy? I can't do something so embarrassing--
-Hurry up, now!

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:34.460
Well, if you insist.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:39.810
I thought so!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.020
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:46.160
Come now, you're elated having
tasted my shoe, aren't you?

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.860
I've never even had Per's cooking.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:53.230
I shouldn't have to put up with Inuzuka getting to eat it.

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.230
As such, I'm confiscating this!

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:00.540
Too slow!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.990
-Hold it, you!
-You won't catch me like that.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.300
The bento!

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:17.210
I improved my time by another 0.01 sec--

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.770
What in the--?

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:21.520
Sorry, Scott! That's mine.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.970
Lady Persia's home cooking?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:25.940
Yeah.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.600
No matter how you look at it,
there's enough for two.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:32.970
Could it be? You made it for me after seeing me
train in secret for the sports festival?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:36.870
How kind of you. Come, let's eat it over there!

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:38.160
Hold on!

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.940
-If only time would stop right now.
-Stop right there!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.960
Scott!

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:52.430
Inuzuka. So, you've stolen it. Now what will you do?

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:56.800
Do you intend to violate the bento Lady Persia made?

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.770
That's right.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.590
That's right! Oh, it's drenched with sauce.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.090
You bastard!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.270
Scott, let me handle--

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:07.840
No. Please stand back.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.720
I'll be the one to dispose of him.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:15.600
You want to go, you goldfish turd?

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.660
It's just a bento, why has it come to this?

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.100
This is quite the development.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.230
Handle!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.070
A telegraphed punch won't work!

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.330
Weaklings should go sleep peacefully.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:35.700
Did you call me a weakling?

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.830
Let me correct you!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.680
It's my duty to be Lady Persia's shield.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.230
I won't yield to the likes of you.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:51.570
Lady Persia saved me when I'd strayed from the path.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:55.240
-That's right. If not for her, I'd have--
-Shut up.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:58.350
What good does stopping to reminisce do you?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.600
I don't give a rat's ass about your past.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.530
Give it back already!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.630
You're overdoing it!

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.260
The bento!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.430
I can't give up yet!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.080
The moment I give up...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.520
our lunch is over!

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:33.190
Hey, get back! That's not feed!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:34.800
It's gone!

00:07:36.990 --> 00:07:39.240
Persia's hand cooked food...

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.440
became pig feed.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.580
No way.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.940
The bento...

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:50.210
Goodness. I didn't think it would come to this.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:51.950
I feel a little contrite.

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:57.330
I can't even protect Lady Persia's bento.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:03.520
Come with me Scott.
I'll make do with you as a plaything for today.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.830
I can't breathe!

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.840
Damn it all.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:15.450
All of Persia's hard work...

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.400
gone to waste.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.470
-Forgive me!
-I'm sorry!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.240
The truth is...

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:25.540
I'd never done it before so I couldn't cook anything.

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:28.730
But, I didn't want to disappoint you...

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:32.240
so I had the kitchen maid make that bento for me!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:35.050
I'm sorry I didn't tell you!

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:36.810
So, we...

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.720
were fighting over the kitchen maid's bento?

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:42.250
Don't do battle over me!

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:51.440
If you want something handmade so badly...

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:58.160
These were sort of a failure,
but you can have them if you want.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.820
They're handmade cookies.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:08.110
If you don't want them,
I'd intended to eat them myself.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.590
I want them.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:17.300
Just don't get your hopes up about the flavor.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:19.090
I burned them a little.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.760
That doesn't matter!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:23.470
Anything made by you...

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.220
Holy--!

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.850
Just kidding!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:31.640
They're actually really good!

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.190
I mean...

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:37.640
I'm sure they're good!

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:41.490
Enough! That's why I said they were failures!

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:42.990
You meant it.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.490
You should've believed me.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.150
Why are you laughing?

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.650
Sorry. I was just thinking...

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:54.240
you're a surprisingly normal girl
with normal problems.

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:58.560
You should have just told me
you weren't good at cooking.

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:02.240
Be quiet. I have to be perfect.

00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:06.250
You can relax when you're around me, at least.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:11.520
We're secret lovers anyway. No one will find out.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:18.190
Shut your mouth. Next time, I'll make an exquisite bento

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:20.570
and make you eat your words along with it.

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:23.240
I'll practice when I get home.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:27.090
-I'll help!
-You can't come with me, idiot!

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:30.770
Come on, pigs go, "oink oink"!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:35.620
Save me, Lady Persia!

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.630
Oink!

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:44.040
White Cats will taste defeat! Touwa guys will not be beat!

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.660
White Cats will taste defeat!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.190
-Touwa guys will not be beat!
-Don't slow down!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:51.630
-They're really into it.
-Pick it up! You want to lose to the White Cats?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:53.630
Inuzuka, you idiot!

00:10:59.730 --> 00:11:01.990
Three more laps!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.070
I can't go on.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:06.890
We've been running since morning.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.160
Do your best.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:14.860
If you get dehydrated, we'll bring you cold drinks
and wipe your sweat away as a reward!

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.360
Let's do this!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.000
Out of the way! I'm the one Hasuki will be wiping!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.240
Ten more laps, you've got this!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:26.930
Wow, everyone's controlled by their lust.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:29.620
It's way too hot for all this.

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:32.850
So we agree, for once.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:35.430
The sports festival is nothing but a pain, huh?

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.040
Don't talk to me.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:40.510
I'd be inconvenienced if we lost to the White Cats.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:44.220
We're about to discuss how we can win using foul play.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:47.360
Should we leave a banana peel on the track?

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.660
I can eat the banana.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.520
We could put sleeping pills in the bread
at the eating contest.

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:56.150
Even Maru feels like taking it seriously? I can't believe it.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:59.280
-By the way, you'd better not compete this year.
-What?

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.650
I won't let you tell me you've forgotten.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.030
The Black Doggies lost last year because of--

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.030
That hurt! What are you doing?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.760
I didn't want to compete anyway.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.790
-You're looking at Inuzuka again?
-I'm not looking at him!

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:14.290
What's wrong? You've been pretty quiet lately.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:18.890
I'm a little confused as to what I should do.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.690
Then why don't you aim for it, too?

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.430
-The MVP's Jinx.
-Jinx?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:26.940
Whoever wins "MVP" at the sports festival

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:29.850
dances with their chosen partner
at the festival's closing party,

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:32.940
and the jinx ensures their 100 percent success
as a couple.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.810
One hundred percent?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:39.660
Dance with Inuzuka! Hey!

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.460
-What's up?
-Go on.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:43.670
No, Inuzuka already...

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:48.300
Hey, if Hasuki wins MVP,
dance with her at the festival's closing party!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.450
I really don't need you to intervene!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.840
Dance?

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:53.530
Hey, hey!

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:56.210
Well, if Hasuki said she wanted to dance...

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.100
The jinx really has nothing to do with it.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.310
Jinx?

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:04.720
Let's both do our best!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.600
I'm telling you, it's not like that!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.350
"Let's do our best!"

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.700
Damn. I hate this stupid sports festival.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:23.460
-I wish it'd hurry up and be over.
-Black Doggies are lower than dirt!

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.590
Black Doggies are lower than dirt!

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.380
-They're slow, ill-mannered, and clumsy!
-They're slow, ill-mannered, and clumsy.

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:33.220
I, Scott, will aim for the title of MVP.

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.850
-Then I'll ask Persia to dance...
-Stupid dogs, stupid dogs, stupid dogs!

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.310
...and we'll become a couple!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.520
What the hell are you doing?

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.130
That's a vulgar song you sing!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.440
-You're the personification of vulgarity!
-Inuzuka?

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:50.780
Everyone's excited about the dumb sports festival.

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.030
Oh, that's right, knave.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:58.650
You're a war criminal from last year's sports festival.
The 100-meter race.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.830
Won't you help the White Cats achieve another victory?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.780
You ass!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:10.280
This girl... With one hand?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:12.470
Somali Longhaired
White Cats House - 1st Year

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:15.180
Who are you? Where did you barge in from?

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:15.910
Somali Longhaired
White Cats House - 1st Year

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:20.020
I'm trembling! What a great punch!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:20.980
Somali, I told you to act with respect.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:24.040
Aby Ssinia
White Cats House - 1st Year

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:24.050
White Cats House - 1st Year
Aby Ssinia

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:26.050
Aby!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:31.030
Aby! I stopped Inuzuka's punch.
Aren't I great? Praise me!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:34.220
-No, I'm upset with you.
-Who are you?

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:38.810
Come on now. I can't believe after 10 years
of attending the same school, you don't remember.

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:41.540
I'm Aby Ssinia.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.960
I'm not bragging, but I placed first
in my class in the hottie contest.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.790
Still not bragging, I do modeling--

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:51.380
-Hey, I'm Somali! Aby's girlfriend.
-Also, I was a runway model.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:55.420
-Again, not bragging, I'm the top in my class--
-Aby and I made vows about our future.

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.010
Wait, wait! Who's my girlfriend now? Don't make stuff up.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.390
You don't need to be shy.

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:00.750
Quiet, you delusional girl!

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.930
Don't mind what she says.

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:05.340
-She's a dumbass.
-You're horrible!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.590
What's with this blubbering pair?

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:09.840
On to business...

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:15.280
There's something I wished to ask you,
lovely Miss Persia.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.720
Go ahead.

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:22.990
As always, there is a rift between
the Persia-faction and Aby-faction.

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:25.730
I was thinking we finally join the two.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:29.360
A rift? The White Cats have things like that?

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.170
What do you say?

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:35.990
Once I win MVP at the sports festival,
will you date me?

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:42.250
Sorry, but I don't like shallow men.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.350
My apologies.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.380
-I'll kill him, I'll kill him...
-What's the strange bloodlust I sense? And it's twofold?

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.390
Anyone who makes an enemy of Aby

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:54.940
-will be crushed by me!
-Stop it, Somali!

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:56.060
What did you say?

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:03.150
We all need to back down.
You can settle things soon enough at the sports festival.

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.580
Wait.

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.780
Why are you so upset?

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.880
Could it be...

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:14.550
you're in love...

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.920
with wonderful me?

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.660
-This sinful beauty of mine--
-Shut it, booger boy.

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.300
That's gross! Why'd you do that?

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.970
Be quiet, you damn narcissist.

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:25.560
You little...

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:29.560
Very well. I'll just crush you at the sports festival--

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:31.690
Does Aby love Somali?

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:34.320
Who would love a brainless girl like you?

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.570
You're horrible!

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:38.870
Anyway.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:43.370
We've introduced ourselves.
You'd better go all out at the sports festival.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:45.080
See you later, Persia.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.310
Bye-cha!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:53.290
Talk all you want. It's not like I'm entering.

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:57.330
Inuzuka, hold it! Apologize for stepping on my head!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.340
We've got to win this year.

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:02.460
-Dignitaries from Touwa and the West are coming?
-Yeah.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.140
Our reputation is on the line.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:07.850
-Why's everyone so fired up about this?
-Let's do our best!

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:13.300
A note arrow? Which means...

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:20.280
Tomorrow morning at five,
come to the grounds without anyone noticing.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.030
Help me practice for the three-legged race.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:24.870
From Persia.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:27.620
I'll be waiting, Inuzuka!

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:33.280
Three-legged race? That's where you run
with your legs tied together and your shoulders joined.

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:38.050
Touching shoulder to shoulder, and leg to leg.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.380
Shoulder to shoulder.

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:41.660
Leg to leg.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.170
Shut up!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.430
Good morning. Did you sleep well?

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:56.440
Sorry about this. I'm bad at three-legged races.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:58.650
Hey, are you listening?

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:04.320
I think the ponytail looks good on you.

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:06.790
Really?

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:10.620
-Enough chat, I'm tying us.
-Okay.

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:15.070
Persia's this close to me?

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.170
Damn. My heart can't take it.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:21.990
-I mustn't!
-What?

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:26.350
Oh, I was just exorcising a demon.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:28.370
I'm over here.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.680
It's done.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:33.900
Is this right?

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:38.060
So close! Persia's sweet scent...

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:40.890
Come on, put your arm over my shoulder.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.910
Something's off.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.650
Our height difference...

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:54.650
Let's do this.

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:58.750
Are you okay?

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.800
Sorry. The stimulation-- I mean--

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:07.300
Anyway, you're pretty determined
about this sports festival.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.470
Well, yeah.

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:16.570
If I win MVP, I can increase my appeal
to the West's audience.

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:18.980
That would help my father, too.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.280
All right. Let's do it.

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:27.280
Well, I see you've gotten serious about it.

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:29.100
I'm always serious.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:32.200
Persia is counting on me.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.110
If I don't live up to her expectations...

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:37.380
-Ready? Go!
-I'm not a man!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.400
-All right!
-Perfect!

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:02.400
Are you sure you're bad at three-legged races?
It doesn't seem that way.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:06.070
You're not bad yourself. That starting dash was perfect.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:10.490
Do you have some confidence now?

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.520
It's because of last year's sports festival, right?

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:18.290
In the latter half of the matches, the points were even.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.790
The 100-meter dash would decide the victors.

00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:23.170
On your marks, get set...

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:28.910
You were too amped up and had a false start.

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:32.250
False start, false start! He's drowning us out!

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:35.590
You ran all the way to the goal without noticing.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.670
When they redid it, you were worn out and got last place.

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:41.230
In the end, the Black Doggies lost.

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:43.440
Inuzuka, you dumbass!

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.740
You can make up for it this time.

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.950
It's like you said the other day.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:51.450
The other day?

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:55.740
Inuzuka, you can relax when you're around me.

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:57.770
Can't you?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.830
If you act like you're not having a good time,

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:04.280
I'll start to feel depressed, too.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.790
This was for me?

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:13.140
-If you don't fight with all you've got, I'll be angry.
-Yeah...

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:15.850
What's with that response?

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:20.550
Then, if I'm the MVP,
you'll have to obey one order from me.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:25.550
What? Then if I'm the MVP,
will you take an order from me?

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.240
Yes, that's fine.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.660
No, it's not fine.

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:34.810
-I must have Persia do whatever I say.
-Forget I said that. It can't be anything weird!

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:37.690
-I must have Persia do whatever...
-Listen to me!

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:44.780
All right! I'll be the representative in the 100-meter dash!

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:47.800
-Inuzuka!
-You...

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.410
I said not to enter.

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.720
Don't be an idiot. The sports festival is the best!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:52.840
<b>Simple-minded
Don't be an idiot. The sports festival is the best!</b>

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:54.040
<b>Simple-minded</b>

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.600
<b>The Day of the Sports Festival</b>

00:21:56.600 --> 00:22:03.350
The three-day Dahlia Academy
High School sports festival has finally begun!

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:06.480
The first day will be the first-years!

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:12.560
In this Dahlia arena, the struggle for pride
between the Black Doggies and White Cats begins!

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:20.920
Something unexpected might happen
at this year's sports festival.

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:48.730
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:56.740
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:56.910 --> 00:23:04.040
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:10.670
I want to match the love you have for me

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:18.890
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:19.050 --> 00:23:25.230
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:32.480
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:34.690
I want to support you

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:42.530
With everything I have

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:50.630
Until the world can one day change

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:56.720
Now then, little kitties,
keep an eye on my efforts next time--

00:23:56.720 --> 00:24:00.250
If Somali wins MVP, will Aby like her even more?

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:03.330
-Even if you win MVP, your stupid strength--
-Aby you dummy!

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:04.100
Juliet and the Sports Festival

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:05.270
Next time...
Juliet and the Sports Festival

00:24:05.270 --> 00:24:07.000
"Juliet and the Sports Festival."
Juliet and the Sports Festival

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:07.010
"Juliet and the Sports Festival."
